---

# Explainability

Example

The Hip Thrust is selected because explosive hip extension is fundamental to sprinting, kicking, throwing and many grappling actions.

Compared with heavier bilateral lifts, it provides a high training stimulus with relatively low systemic fatigue, allowing the athlete to maintain technical quality during combat practice.

